/-!
# Local restrictions on the outer FF alternatives

Residual proves the normal-cubic and fixed-seed restrictions from the actual
local residual, normalizer and two-core hypotheses. A6CyclicThree uses the
literal A₆ × C₃ model and its compatible inversion to exclude B.5.6(4),
for the selected endpoint module V_alpha.

The proper symmetric extensions in B.5.1(1)(i), the S₅ factors in B.5.6(3),
and the G₂(2) extension still require their local geometric exclusions.
These modules therefore do not yet prove the complete outer exclusion,
the exhaustive B.5.6 dispatch, or source 15.3.49(i).

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, combined manuscript (1 March 2004), printed
pp.99–110 and 1141–1144.
-/
